WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.880
With an agenda weighted heavily with momentous world problems, the United Nations Security

00:10.880 --> 00:16.000
Council meets in its new temporary headquarters at Lake Success, Long Island, New York.

00:16.000 --> 00:21.520
Flags of 51 nations seeking worldwide peace fly before the Council buildings as the sessions

00:21.520 --> 00:24.080
resume after a summer recess.

00:24.080 --> 00:33.840
Standing over as chairman is Poland's Dr. Oskar Lange.

00:33.840 --> 00:39.000
Russia's Gromyko sponsors two new membership applicants, Italy's near neighbor, Albania,

00:39.000 --> 00:47.280
and the other Soviet protege, Outer Mongolia.

00:47.280 --> 00:51.440
While the delegates ponder the issue, acting United States Representative Herschel Johnson

00:51.440 --> 00:55.240
with Britain's Cadogan threatens to veto the proposal.

00:55.240 --> 01:21.800
Once more, the machinery for world unity is set in motion.

